WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.610
Most sales die from silence, not from a clear no.

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.775
This lesson is about follow-up 3×.

00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:07.580
Most sales die from silence.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:10.107
Do not treat this as theory only.

00:00:10.107 --> 00:00:13.716
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:13.716 --> 00:00:19.131
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:19.131 --> 00:00:23.101
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:27.072
Stay practical: schedule three follow-ups before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:27.392 --> 00:00:30.115
